# NOTE: do not add blanket `*.md` / `*.csv` rules here. The four documents
# named in content.config.ts (SOURCE_FILENAMES) are build inputs: the
# generate-content step reads them from the project root and fails hard if
# any is missing, and src/content/generated/ is itself ignored. Blanket
# rules would leave the repo unbuildable from a fresh clone.
